398676,\"name\":\"Max Boekhoff\",\"character\":\"Henry\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":1348186,\"name\":\"Mia Kasalo\",\"character\":\"Desiree\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/1FdNoKPHZut8ClhJTErCDXhNqdx.jpg\"},{\"id\":18152,\"name\":\"Mirko Lang\",\"character\":\"Jakob\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/csokofp23Ery8L5vABMzzQgwolt.jpg\"},{\"id\":150802,\"name\":\"Claes Bang\",\"character\":\"Micha\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/allXGdenaUpFq1bJSIeZPkJeHfe.jpg\"},{\"id\":1521861,\"name\":\"Stephanie Krogmann\",\"character\":\"Junge Elli\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/2hOT11hgTAzOGXiwgB5uYWDDi8P.jpg\"},{\"id\":45950,\"name\":\"Harald Glitz\",\"character\":\"Hausmeister\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/cPnsLpGwP7YD2j1bZOQn1g1AClz.jpg\"}],\"similar\":[{\"id\":12536,\"title\":\"Home Alone 4\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/qRktvMOO2QaCL7gvNyvZDoxPOZj.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/171wf8HVXZAIScPf9zJyrXpxgRB.jpg\",\"rating\":4.5,\"year\":2002,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Kevin McCallister's parents have split up. Now living with his mom, he decides to spend Christmas with his dad at the mansion of his father's rich girlfriend, Natalie. Meanwhile robber Marv Merchants, one of the villains from the first two movies, partners up with a new criminal named Vera to hit Natalie's mansion.\",\"genres\":[\"Comedy\",\"Family\",\"TV Movie\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":864390,\"title\":\"Mickey and Minnie Wish Upon a Christmas\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/viZ3SvvQi7CRHJxnSKAG2lHU4AK.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/8fW0wqB3a6dvIoIBduCKocZi58a.jpg\",\"rating\":7,\"year\":2021,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"After a series of mishaps, Mickey, Minnie and the gang are separated all over the world and must try to get back to Hot Dog Hills by Christmas Eve. A mysterious and jolly stranger shows up to tell them about The Wishing Star, which could be the secret to bringing everybody home in time to celebrate together.\",\"genres\":[\"Animation\",\"TV Movie\",\"Comedy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":50393,\"title\":\"Kung Fu Panda Holiday\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/vJv3pI8pyS13rLjy0ok7a3BiE0a.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/cMR6Mpo8N6JVKbEuxet6N0p1NMA.jpg\",\"rating\":7,\"year\":2010,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"The Winter Feast is Po's favorite holiday. Every year he and his father hang decorations, cook together, and serve noodle soup to the villagers. But this year Shifu informs Po that as Dragon Warrior, it is his duty to host the formal Winter Feast at the Jade Palace. Po is caught between his obligations as the Dragon Warrior and his family traditions: between Shifu and Mr. Ping.\",\"genres\":[\"Animation\",\"Family\",\"TV Movie\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":643882,\"title\":\"The Princess Switch: Switched Again\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/4vOmeimnVCdojwvc4icyeYUCydJ.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/zCHe8ckyufHVUZaoHu2DiF8evET.jpg\",\"rating\":6.8,\"year\":2020,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"When Duchess Margaret unexpectedly inherits the throne & hits a rough patch with Kevin, it’s up to Stacy to save the day before a new lookalike — party girl Fiona — foils their plans.\",\"genres\":[\"Family\",\"Romance\",\"Comedy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":79113,\"title\":\"A Princess for Christmas\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/qv7fx4gW2bNU3eUiwtaxh829Imq.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/ocyOdgL8pGS5KRpRfS69SsS2GMa.jpg\",\"rating\":7,\"year\":2011,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"After her sister and brother-in-law's tragic deaths, an American woman who is the guardian for her young niece and nephew is invited to a royal European castle for Christmas by her late brother-in-law's father, the Duke of Castlebury. Feeling out of place as a commoner, she is determined to give her family a merry Christmas and surprises herself when she falls for a handsome prince.\",\"genres\":[\"Comedy\",\"Family\",\"TV Movie\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":33871,\"title\":\"Merry Christmas, Drake & Josh\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/59GoXODSKpd3yMXgM4xXlNmf7jq.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/1f0G7KtLFHwDMFVsvx48WfPVoA9.jpg\",\"rating\":7.3,\"year\":2008,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Step brothers Drake and Josh must give a foster family the best Christmas ever or face years in jail for a Christmas party gone wrong.\",\"genres\":[\"Comedy\",\"Family\",\"TV Movie\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":81440,\"title\":\"Good Luck Charlie, It's Christmas!\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/ecuJMYZM3HQ96mnWtmyXoHb7s7T.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/3SXATaC4JZA8qxLyAUFjcq17BBV.jpg\",\"rating\":6.7,\"year\":2011,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Teddy Duncan's middle-class family embarks on a road trip from their home in Denver to visit Mrs. Duncans Parents, the Blankenhoopers, in Palm Springs. When they find themselves stranded between Denver and Utah, they try to hitch a ride to Las Vegas with a seemingly normal older couple in a station wagon from Roswell, New Mexico. It turns out that the couple believes they are the victims of alien abduction. The Duncan's must resort to purchasing a clunker Yugo to get to Utah, have their luggage stolen in Las Vegas, and survive a zany Christmas with Grandpa and Grandma Blankenhooper.\",\"genres\":[\"Comedy\",\"Family\",\"Drama\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":363483,\"title\":\"12 Gifts of Christmas\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/2gBuhcMRL03OLd5IOD5cVFe8gBv.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/rwUorXcUSTLo0CJo48JEenhzjRR.jpg\",\"rating\":6.1,\"year\":2015,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"When Anna Parisi, an unemployed fine arts painter, is unable to make ends meet, she is hired to become a personal Christmas shopper for Marc, an uptight corporate exec.  As they begin working together, Marc learns that Christmas giving has less to do with the amount of money spent and more to do with the importance of the gift, while Anna discovers she might find success as an artist in a way she never expected.  The best gift of all of course is the love they discover with one another.\",\"genres\":[\"Family\",\"TV Movie\",\"Comedy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":298016,\"title\":\"It's a SpongeBob Christmas!\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/ljGH5vzF51OXUA74mWsIt9vQw3i.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/5uw5jBtSbCxatLMUGSN62inDWCn.jpg\",\"rating\":7.1,\"year\":2012,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"At Christmastime in Bikini Bottom, everyone's excited except Plankton, who always gets a lump of coal from Santa. But he vows this year he'll finally get his wish – the Krabby Patty formula! And it won't be by being good. He's gonna make everyone in Bikini Bottom bad!\",\"genres\":[\"Family\",\"Animation\",\"Comedy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":50506,\"title\":\"Mrs. Miracle\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/x4bgbJqRaiDC8wSPQNzVtn4iEsq.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/fMCkkqpAVfFmbf009flydh7gQY4.jpg\",\"rating\":6,\"year\":2009,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Overwhelmed widower Seth Webster is searching for a housekeeper to help him with his unruly six year old twin sons. \\\"Mrs. Miracle\\\" mysteriously appears and quickly becomes an irreplaceable nanny, chef, friend... and matchmaker.\",\"genres\":[\"TV Movie\",\"Comedy\",\"Family\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":762879,\"title\":\"Christmas...Again?!\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/tCE4EHfSfGJHKSBIvbSCtplElLE.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/mFDUO48v1Cik3MToFgBsF2Milvv.jpg\",\"rating\":6.6,\"year\":2021,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Rowena \\\"Ro\\\" is a high-spirited 11-year-old hoping to add more spunk to her Christmas celebrations when her parents’ divorce is going anything but smoothly.\",\"genres\":[\"Family\",\"Comedy\",\"Fantasy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1255883,\"title\":\"Alex Edelman: Just for Us\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/kUFBY1vF4sCHVTv1Oy9s23269Or.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/x7FvGNMA451hCIGTS23x98midnc.jpg\",\"rating\":7.6,\"year\":2024,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"In the wake of a string of anti-Semitic threats pointed in his direction online, Edelman decides to go straight to the source; specifically, Queens, where he covertly attends a meeting of White Nationalists and comes face-to-face with the people behind the keyboards.\",\"genres\":[\"Comedy\",\"TV Movie\"],\"daysUntil\":null}],\"videos\":[{\"key\":\"OdHuNKjJ2NY\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"},{\"key\":\"wqjvJMnVPlw\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"},{\"key\":\"RyIbZvhH-P4\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"}],\"daysUntil\":null}","status":200,"url":""},"revalidate":86400,"tags":[]}